e only limiting factor", "url": "https://x.com/Imran_Razaq/status/2117024096747675825"}, {"author_id": "2891280648", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:31:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117021835111911557"], "id": "2117021835111911557", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116992258520064397", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Me, a Meta Muse enjoyer on the free plan, seeing how Dots users and Grok Bot users have been getting jebaited and bamboozled with usage limits and realizing a reckoning may come for me soon: 😨 https://t.co/wS1KxjNIrX", "url": "https://x.com/midnightbobarun/status/2117021835111911557"}, {"article": {"title": "456X Evening Brief — November 1, 2026: Expansion Bottlenecks Tighten as Financing Costs and Power"}, "author_id": "849661480869912576", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:16:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117017963517956331"], "id": "2117017963517956331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 277, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/2ryeVjUVLR", "url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2117017963517956331"}, {"author_id": "1709011399", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:15:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117017698173628633"], "id": "2117017698173628633", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2340, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116992258520064397", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @Teslaconomics @DogecoinNorway Can you at least let us know what the hell happened? I was at 50% last night and then I went to 100% almost instantly while my thought was doing a few tasks that it normally does.. probably gonna have to cancel my $300 month subscription and keep using my meta muse if that’s the", "url": "https://x.com/optionscjp/status/2117017698173628633"}, {"author_id": "111855323", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:14:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117017410293387726"], "id": "2117017410293387726", "in_reply_to_user_id": "166138615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117010858845089805", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@amasad Meta Muse clears grokbot idk why yall pay for that shit", "url": "https://x.com/bingespresso/status/2117017410293387726"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117015335781965824"]}, "author_id": "18070827", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:06:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117015338969649661"], "id": "2117015338969649661", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I wrote a book — and today it appeared on my Kindle for the first time. 📚\n\n100 Amazing Projects and Things You Can Do with Your Own Meta Muse Assistant Today! — out Friday, November 6.\n\nSeeing my name on that screen made it real. ❤️ #FirstTimeAuthor #MetaMuse #AI https://t.co/SlS320HtoX", "url": "https://x.com/charlessued/status/2117015338969649661"}, {"author_id": "274629912", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:53:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117012113562743055"], "id": "2117012113562743055", "in_reply_to_user_id": "17050482", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 142, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116992478926581874", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AdamLowisz @elonmusk @DogecoinNorway Default with Meta Muse. Can see weekly usage.", "url": "https://x.com/BrianKehm/status/2117012113562743055"}, {"author_id": "2892878899", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:39:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117008761227444268"], "id": "2117